    <label>space sapphire</label>
    <description>A brilliant blue crystal that seems to contain infinite depth, gazing into it feels like peering into the void between worlds. The magic of this sapphire can be invoked to instantly transport anything within a large radius to a distant location, after which it cannot be used again, the sapphire will tear reality if destroyed.</description>
